  "FLUX.3 per-block": "FLUX.3 逐块编译",
  "guard_filter_fn": "guard_filter_fn",
  "dynamic": "dynamic",
  "max-autotune": "max-autotune",
  "max-autotune-no-cudagraphs": "max-autotune-no-cudagraphs",
  "reduce-overhead": "reduce-overhead",
  "**torch.compile** speeds up the inference by compiling the model ahead of time\n- **guard_filter_fn:** Compile the Fastest ; Require recompilation if Resolution / Batch Size is changed\n- **dynamic:** Support any Resolution / Batch Size ; Slower to Compile\n- **max-autotune:** Best Runtime Speed ; Require recompilation if Resolution / Batch Size is changed ; Does not work with --cuda-malloc\n- **max-autotune-no-cudagraphs:** Support any Resolution / Batch Size ; Faster than **dynamic** ; Even Slower to Compile\n- **reduce-overhead:** Similar to **max-autotune** ; Require recompilation if Resolution / Batch Size is changed ; Does not work with --cuda-malloc\n- **Anima per-block:** Compile each Anima transformer block separately; a changed Resolution / Batch Size recompiles once into a dynamic-shape graph, but Batch Size 1 (CFG 1, or steps outside the CFG range) and reference images still compile graphs of their own ; lower graph-break risk than whole-model compile\n- **MOSS-Image per-block:** Compile each MOSS-Image transformer layer separately; stays compiled with Skip Layer Guidance (SLG) and cached reference KV while keeping one-shot reference preprocessing eager ; lower graph-break risk than whole-model compile\n- **Krea-2 per-block:** Compile each Krea 2 single-stream transformer block separately; keeps cached text fusion and RoPE outside the compiled blocks and stays compiled with Skip Layer Guidance (SLG) and Edit reference latents ; lower graph-break risk than whole-model compile\n- **FLUX.3 per-block:** Compile each FLUX.3 joint single block separately; the text and reference per-mode blocks run once per prompt outside the compiled blocks ; lower graph-break risk than whole-model compile": "**torch.compile** 预先编译模型以加快推理\n- **guard_filter_fn：** 编译最快；分辨率 / 批量大小改变时需要重新编译\n- **dynamic：** 支持任意分辨率 / 批量大小；编译较慢\n- **max-autotune：** 运行速度最快；分辨率 / 批量大小改变时需要重新编译；不支持 --cuda-malloc\n- **max-autotune-no-cudagraphs：** 支持任意分辨率 / 批量大小；比 **dynamic** 更快；编译更慢\n- **reduce-overhead：** 与 **max-autotune** 类似；分辨率 / 批量大小改变时需要重新编译；不支持 --cuda-malloc\n- **Anima per-block：** 逐个编译 Anima Transformer 块；分辨率 / 批量大小改变时只重新编译一次为动态形状图，但批量大小 1（CFG 1，或 CFG 范围外的步数）与参考图仍会编译各自的图；图中断风险低于整模型编译\n- **MOSS-Image per-block：** 逐个编译 MOSS-Image Transformer 层；在开启跳层引导（SLG）与参考图 KV 缓存时仍保持编译运行，并将一次性参考图预处理保留为 eager 模式；图中断风险低于整模型编译\n- **Krea-2 per-block：** 逐个编译 Krea 2 单流 Transformer 块；将已缓存的文本融合与 RoPE 保留在编译块之外，并在开启跳层引导（SLG）与 Edit 参考图潜变量时仍保持编译运行；图中断风险低于整模型编译\n- **FLUX.3 per-block：** 逐个编译 FLUX.3 联合单流块；文本与参考图的逐模态块每个提示词只运行一次且位于编译块之外；图中断风险低于整模型编译"
}
